    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d52">

                <pb facs="0110" n="86" sameAs="frus:frus1864p4/pg86"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Koerner.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 109.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-06-27"><hi rendition="#italic">June
                                27,</hi> 1864</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have especial satisfaction in
                    acknowledging the receipt of your despatch of the 3d of June, No. 101. It was
                    written, indeed, before the Spanish government had received direct and full
                    information from its agents in Peru. Nevertheless, your account of the
                    demonstrations which that government has made concerning the unhappy
                    difficulties at Lima seems to authorize an expectation that these difficulties
                    will be adjusted in a way that shall be at once peaceful and consistent with the
                    safety, honor, and welfare of both countries. I find no occasion at present to
                    enlarge my instructions heretofore given.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gustavus Koerner</hi>, Esq., &amp;<hi
                            rendition="#italic">c</hi>., &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.,
                            &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.<hi rendition="#italic">,
                            Madrid.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
